# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Do NOT use broad patterns like BlueLM*, Qwen*, result*, run.sh, mmb_* here:
# on case-insensitive filesystems they match real package files (bluelm_api.py,
# result_transfer.py, scripts/run.sh, mmb_eval_gradio.py, internvl/, etc.) so
# they never get committed. Use repo-root anchors (/name) or paths under outputs/.
# Per-machine junk → .git/info/exclude or a global gitignore.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

